{"id":1745597,"retrievedAt":"2026-08-08T11:49:38.485Z","response":{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"belongs_to_collection":null,"budget":0,"genres":[],"homepage":"","id":1745597,"imdb_id":null,"origin_country":["US"],"original_language":"en","original_title":"Jubah Dari Mekah","overview":"Mak Leha, a single mother, raises her two children, Shakir and Nabila (Abil). Abil becomes a drug addict. Shakir desperately locks Abil under the house because he doesn't want Abil to get drug supplies anymore. Mak Leha cannot bear to see Abil confined like that. Seeing Abil becoming increasingly desperate and addicted, Mak Leha is willing to obtain drug supplies for Abil. At the same time, Mak Leha desires to perform umrah with her savings. Shakir wants to fulfill his mother's wish to go to the holy land, although his wife, Elis, disagrees because she dislikes Mak Leha and Abil. However, seeing Abil's condition worsening, Mak Leha has changed her desire to go to Mecca by sacrificing her wish for Abil instead. Initially, Shakir objects because to him Abil only causes trouble to him and his mother. But considering it as one of the last ways to rehabilitate Abil, he agrees.","popularity":0,"poster_path":"/zCmUThB70fxk1gvQRm29SWiPDds.jpg","production_companies":[{"id":119726,"logo_path":null,"name":"Luqsar Kreatif Sdn Bhd","origin_country":""}],"production_countries":[],"release_date":"2019-01-01","revenue":0,"runtime":0,"softcore":false,"spoken_languages":[],"status":"Released","tagline":"","title":"Jubah Dari Mekah","video":false,"vote_average":0,"vote_count":0,"alternative_titles":{"titles":[]},"credits":{"cast":[{"adult":false,"gender":1,"id":1294383,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Norlia Ghani","original_name":"Norlia Ghani","popularity":0.4663,"profile_path":"/shjQYsfhz5Be1RqZIeYoa7QvmP0.jpg","cast_id":2,"character":"","credit_id":"6a76872837372b3dcabbb4e7","order":0},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1172819,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Rusdi Ramli","original